From 9ae88385f71b482e1db6f162c95452ac8fc71fba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kentaro Hayashi <hayashi@clear-code.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Feb 2025 16:43:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Use hardcoded runtime.GOOS/goruntime.GOOS

Behaves as if "linux"

Signed-off-by: Kentaro Hayashi <hayashi@clear-code.com>
---
 cmd/podman/compose.go              | 4 ++--
 cmd/podman/machine/info.go         | 2 +-
 cmd/podman/registry/config.go      | 2 +-
 libpod/boltdb_state_internal.go    | 6 +++---
